{"repositoryId":1121421863,"availability":"available","full":"RivicQ/RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS","name":"RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS","description":"RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS is a open source Cryptographic Bill of Materials platform designed specifically for  banking and financial services. Our comprehensive scanning and analysis solution provides full visibility into cryptographic assets while ensuring quantum-safe migration and compliance with BSI Germany , eIDAS 2.0 and DORA regulations","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":3,"forks":1,"created":"2025-12-23T01:13:02Z","updated":"2026-10-15T14:56:28Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rivicq.github.io/RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS/","topics":[],"demo":"https://rivicq.github.io/RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:12.227Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:12.227Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T15:02:12.227Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T15:02:12.227Z","stars":3,"forks":1}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RivicQ GmbH (Berlin) · Community open source (Apache License 2.0) and Enterprise (commercial)","RivicQ is Cryptographic Security Posture Management (CSPM): Community inventories cryptography (CBOM) and software components (SBOM). QBOM, HBOM, AIBOM, and IBOM are licensed Enterprise control-plane layers. The same cryptographic intelligence engine powers Community (Apache-2.0) and Enterprise (commercial). Editions are licenses and feature entitlements, not a second scanner.","The Community console is the RivicQ Security Cloud — deep-space nebula chrome (#000000 canvas, violet #7C3AED) with Inter and JetBrains Mono. Light mode remains available. RivicQ Graph (wordmark GRAPH) is the labeled security-graph demo at /fabric (formerly NEXUS / FABRIC). Control mappings are not certifications."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RivicQ/RivicQ_CSPM_EaaS/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cf96d5f2855288a94fda12561feb66c1013e0990b08fa